+// spaces B35: the two-finger Space swipe follows the fingers (owner,
+// 2026-10-01: it switched with no motion at all). While they move, the
+// Space's list goes with them and nothing switches; lifted short of the
+// distance it springs back and the Space stays; lifted past it, the next
